#. UnlockSync: unlock the synced data with the recovery code (U-42). Nearby unlock does not ship in v0.10.0, so no string offers it. The field's label. The code is checked on the device before anything is sent.
msgid "unlockSync.field"
msgstr "Codice di recupero"

#. Unlock
#. UnlockSync: unlock the synced data with the recovery code (U-42). Nearby unlock does not ship in v0.10.0, so no string offers it. The primary action.
msgid "unlockSync.unlock"
msgstr "Sblocca"

#. Start over
#. UnlockSync: unlock the synced data with the recovery code (U-42). Nearby unlock does not ship in v0.10.0, so no string offers it. Opens the confirmation that replaces the sync key; the second action beside Unlock.
msgid "unlockSync.startOver"
msgstr "Ricomincia da capo"

#. macos: Start Over
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "unlockSync.startOver"
msgstr "Ricomincia da capo"

#. That code isn't right. Check it and try again.
#. UnlockSync: unlock the synced data with the recovery code (U-42). Nearby unlock does not ship in v0.10.0, so no string offers it. Shown under the field when the code's check characters fail or the server refuses it.
msgid "unlockSync.invalid"
msgstr "Il codice non è corretto. Controllalo e riprova."

#. Couldn't unlock. Check your connection and try again.
#. UnlockSync: unlock the synced data with the recovery code (U-42). Nearby unlock does not ship in v0.10.0, so no string offers it. The unlock request failed for a reason other than the code.
msgid "unlockSync.failed"
msgstr "Impossibile sbloccare. Controlla la connessione e riprova."

#. Couldn't start over. Check your connection and try again.
#. UnlockSync: Start over failed (not an unlock failure); Try again repeats it.
msgid "unlockSync.startOverFailed"
msgstr "Impossibile ricominciare. Controlla la connessione e riprova."

#. This account has no recovery code. On a device that's still signed in and unlocked, choose New recovery code. Otherwise, start over.
#. UnlockSync: the account has no recovery code, so unlocking cannot work; Start over is the way on.
msgid "unlockSync.noCode"
msgstr "Questo account non ha un codice di recupero. Su un dispositivo ancora connesso e sbloccato, scegli «Nuovo codice di recupero». Altrimenti, ricomincia."

#. Start over?
#. UnlockSync: unlock the synced data with the recovery code (U-42). Nearby unlock does not ship in v0.10.0, so no string offers it. The confirmation's title.
msgid "unlockSync.startOverTitle"
msgstr "Ricominciare da capo?"

#. Your current synced data will be lost. Start over only if you can't find your recovery code.
#. UnlockSync: unlock the synced data with the recovery code (U-42). Nearby unlock does not ship in v0.10.0, so no string offers it. The warning on the confirmation: a new sync key leaves the data under the old key unreadable (T22).
msgid "unlockSync.startOverWarning"
msgstr "I tuoi dati sincronizzati attuali andranno persi. Ricomincia da capo solo se non trovi il codice di recupero."

#. Start over
#. UnlockSync: unlock the synced data with the recovery code (U-42). Nearby unlock does not ship in v0.10.0, so no string offers it. The confirmation's destructive action.
msgid "unlockSync.startOverConfirm"
msgstr "Ricomincia da capo"

#. macos: Start Over
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "unlockSync.startOverConfirm"
msgstr "Ricomincia da capo"

