#. Replace a device, inline in the license choice (SIGN-IN.md §3.7). Arguments: {device} = a device's friendly name, for example “Maya's MacBook”; {product} = the product's name from ProductIdentity (never translated); {thisDevice} = the platform phrase for the current device (part.thisDevice, for example “this iPhone”).
